t;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Go每日一题_124</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_124/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Dec 2024 00:36:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_124/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E9%A2%98/">Go每日一题</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/">Go语言基础</category><description>&lt;p&gt;以下代码输出什么？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10; &amp;#34;encoding/json&amp;#34;&#10; &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10; &amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; t := struct {&#10; time.Time&#10; N int&#10; }{&#10; time.Date(2020, 12, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, time.UTC),&#10; 5,&#10; }&#10;&#10; m, _ := json.Marshal(t)&#10; fmt.Printf(&amp;#34;%s&amp;#34;, m)&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A：{&amp;ldquo;Time&amp;rdquo;: &amp;ldquo;2020-12-20T00:00:00Z&amp;rdquo;, &amp;ldquo;N&amp;rdquo;: 5 }；B：&amp;ldquo;2020-12-20T00:00:00Z&amp;rdquo;；C：{&amp;ldquo;N&amp;rdquo;: 5}；D：&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;nil&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Go每日一题_054</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_054/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:44:34 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_054/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E9%A2%98/">Go每日一题</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/">Go语言基础</category><description>&lt;p&gt;以下代码输出什么？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10; &amp;#34;encoding/json&amp;#34;&#10; &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10; &amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; t := struct {&#10; time.Time&#10; N int&#10; }{&#10; time.Date(2020, 12, 20, 0,